  "description": "10.0+a Ha Yeon-hee, who has been hiding her eyesight, ends up slapping someone in the face while trying to catch a mosquito. But that person is our company's youngest and the idol of the female employees! CEO Yoo Jeong-an?!! Jeong-an tries to catch the spy in the company using Yeon-hee's eyesight... . Yeon-hee catches a spy and captures the CEO's heart, and the prickly CEO Jeong-an's eye-cleansing romance.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4653836)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=804159), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9202954)",
